{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stranded and alone on the hostile alien world of Aethergald, Ellie \u2014 a fearless outer space adventurer \u2014 must do whatever it takes to survive. Explore mysterious biomes, battle deadly creatures, and uncover powerful lost technology as you fight to piece together your ship and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358530/extras/a.png?t=1760116763\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master tools like the Static Staff and Energy Pistols to overcome relentless enemies and traverse dangerous terrain. Climb, jump, and unlock new areas using alien tech left behind by an ancient civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358530/extras/b.png?t=1760116763\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a1 <strong>The demo is now available \u2014 play the first two levels for free and get a taste of the adventure that awaits.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358530/extras/C.png?t=1760116763\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3358530/extras/d.png?t=1760116763\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to brave the unknown and help Ellie conquer Aethergald? \ud83d\udc7d</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3358530?t=1760116763","background_raw":"https://store.akam